ke oozing out of his nose  and this is like the fourth time that he  has been forced to react this way since  the raid on the hospital started I can't  really blame him though no one would  ever want to be on miracles bad side  meanwhile at the mansion  Takayama emerges from the safety of fat  gums belly and activates dark shadow in  an attempt to save hogs while back at  the hospital endeavour finally smashes  his way into the secret lab and  absolutely wrecks one of the high-end  nomu beneath his fiery fist miracle is  injured part of her right  rabbit ear has been torn off but she  seems to have survived thanks to  endeavors epic entrance I am assuming  that endeavor showed up in time to save  her because we don't actually see the  full extent of the damage that miracle  has suffered  we are only shown the upper part of her  head and the fact that her ear has been  damaged  I certainly hope that she survived  because I freaking love her and I refuse  to even consider any other possibility  and that is how this absolutely insane  an action-packed chapter ends and wow  what a chapter we had the incredible  showdown between dobby and hawks in  which dobby revealed his secret identity  to hawks although sadly he did not  reveal it to us  the readers we also had Takayama joining  the fight in order to save his mentor  Hawks but Toki ami is still just a you a  student and dobby is a ruthless  overpowered villain this decision to  abandon fat gums belly and face off  against dobby may cost  Takayama dearly in the very near future  in this incredible chapter we also got  to see more miracle greatness including  yet more evidence of her unbelievable  courage and resolve in the face of  impossible odds she is willing to  sacrifice her life for her mission and  she is already one of my favorite pro  heroes and MHA characters of all time  what a hero and what a woman on top of  that endeavor has finally made his way  to the secret lab and the number one pro  hero is about to